## Monorepo (always)

- API runtime: `apps/api`
- Contract: `packages/api` → `@repo/api` (shared with FE — [shared index](../shared/shared-rules-index.mdc))
- Database: `packages/database` → `@repo/database` (when present)
- Không duplicate DTO giữa app và package
- Layout đầy đủ: [shared turbo-workspace](../shared/rules/turbo-workspace.mdc)

## Sub-agents (Core + Extended)

Registry: [agents/README.md](./agents/README.md). Recipes: [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md).

| Tier | Core | Extended cap |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Small | module → QG → reviewer | 0 |
| Medium | module + service \| dto \| prisma | ≤1 |
| Large | full core path | ≤3 |

Governance: [agents/_shared/COMMAND_POLICY.md](./agents/_shared/COMMAND_POLICY.md), [agents/_shared/ESCALATION.md](./agents/_shared/ESCALATION.md).

Manifests: [agents/module/manifests/](./agents/module/manifests/) — `pnpm be:manifest-check`.

## Complex task protocol

1. [agents/WORKFLOW.md](./agents/WORKFLOW.md) — tier + checklist
2. [agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md](./agents/coordinator/AGENTS.md) — core-first, budgets
3. [agents/_shared/output-contract.md](./agents/_shared/output-contract.md) — evidence, severity
4. After implement: **quality-gates** → **reviewer** last

