## Implementation checklist

1. File in correct package (`apps/api` vs `packages/api` vs `packages/database`)
2. Layer: controller / service / dto / prisma
3. DTO in `@repo/api`; factories in tests
4. Module manifest updated for new domains
5. quality-gates → reviewer after non-trivial changes
